@baseUrl = http://localhost:5030/api/FollowUps
@token = paste-a-development-jwt-here
@followUpId = 1
@leadId = 1

### List follow-ups with filters and paging
GET {{baseUrl}}?leadId={{leadId}}&status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's follow-ups
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue follow-ups
GET {{baseUrl}}/overdue?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upcoming follow-ups
GET {{baseUrl}}/upcoming?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a follow-up
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{followUpId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a follow-up as Staff (assignment is derived from the JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leadId": 1,
  "followUpType": "Call",
  "subject": "Confirm travel dates",
  "description": "Discuss the preferred departure week.",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-11-06T15:00:00Z"
}

### Create a follow-up as Admin (active Staff assignment required)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leadId": 1,
  "assignedToUserId": 3,
  "followUpType": "Email",
  "subject": "Send itinerary options",
  "description": "Share three package options.",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-11-06T16:00:00Z"
}

### Update a pending follow-up
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{followUpId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leadId": 1,
  "followUpType": "Meeting",
  "subject": "Review itinerary",
  "description": "Discuss package options.",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-11-07T16:00:00Z"
}

### Reassign follow-up (Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{followUpId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToUserId": 3
}

### Complete and record outcome
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{followUpId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "Customer confirmed the dates and requested a revised quote."
}

### Cancel follow-up
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{followUpId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}